// Acanthus: Telegram colours.
//
// The base Telegram theme is black and white: its "accent" is plain white and
// its links are blue. pwnbox-theme recolours it from the palette, which keeps
// it black and off-white. These lines give it the theme's red where Telegram
// shows an accent (the same dark red as in Discord), and its rose for links
// and other small highlights. Each line replaces that key in the generated
// theme (see sync_telegram in pwnbox-theme).

// accent: only the small marks are filled (badges, file and play circles,
// ticks). Big areas (selected rows, buttons, bubbles) stay black and neutral.
